    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "'Small number' and 'same few' lack fixed thresholds.", "Public imaging is concentrated in model organisms and homologous stages.";
